{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701180/extras/cd8d5d789cba2790f701ece40e6f5d01.avif?t=1767730644\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701180/extras_big/cd8d5d789cba2790f701ece40e6f5d01.avif?t=1767730644 width=800 height=800 /></span><strong>Car Rental Simulator</strong> is a detailed and immersive management game where every decision counts. You'll take control of a real working car rental operation \u2014 handling daily tasks like checking in customers, maintaining vehicles, managing returns, and expanding services as demand grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This simulator isn't just about running a parking lot \u2014 it\u2019s about organizing, planning, and thinking ahead. Each in-game day presents new scenarios that require strategy, time management, and smart decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With deep systems, evolving challenges, and randomized events, <strong>Car Rental Simulator offers high replayability</strong>, rewarding both casual players and those who love perfecting their process.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701180?t=1767730644","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701180?t=1767730644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701180/077543b298cf4ad5bd2801294aaa97dec63f9253/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767730644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701180/077543b298cf4ad5bd2801294aaa97dec63f9253/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767730644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img